There is wrong condition in wp-includes/class-wp-embed.php
Embeds are pulled from cache even if $cached_recently is false = expired.

This condition:

{{{#!php
<?php
if ( $this->usecache || $cached_recently ) {
}}}

should be changed to:

{{{#!php
<?php
if ( $this->usecache && $cached_recently ) {
}}}

